    "english": {
      "headingRaw": "Folk-song-styled-verseLiBaiENDLESSYEARNINGI",
      "translationRaw": "\"IamendlesslyyearningTobeinChangan。。。。Insectshumofautumnbythegoldbrimofthewell；Athinfrostglistenslikelittlemirrorsonmycoldmat；Thehighlanternflickers；and。deepergrowsmylonging。Ilifttheshadeand，withmanyasigh，gazeuponthemoon，Singleasaflower，centredfromtheclouds。Above，Iseethebluenessanddeepnessofsky。Below，Iseethegreennessandtherestlessnessofwater。。。。Heavenishigh，earthwide；bitterbetweenthemfliesmysorrow。CanIdreamthroughthegateway，overthemountain？EndlesslongingBreaksmyheart。\"",
